// Ch6 B03 "The raid" (act1_ch06.md; W05 → W06 → W07 → W05 → W08). Letterboxed.
// W05: the Saltwright salvage camp from the ridge, burning; Stillguard in red-lacquered shell armour
// move through it with torches, unhurried, and they hum the Order's congregational tune with no
// words (bible §4). W06: at the waterline the wrights kneel with their sleeves pushed up; the clerk
// heats the brine-irons in a brazier of coarse salt; a Stillguard holds a girl's arm out over it.
// W07: Toma freezes. Asha says his name twice, the second softer; the camera holds him 2 s past
// comfort. W05: Liss's run along the ridge, straight into Rhen. Asha decides: the hold. W08: the dark
// hold, the lantern the only key light on Liss's face. Then the Inquisitor, and the hound, and Toma
// moves at last. The chapter flow opens the battle (ch06_inquisitor) when this scene ends.
// Watches: never cut Toma's freeze; the decision to hide Liss is Asha's; Toma's line is the slice's
// "On my shield.", now aimed at his own order.
// Ysolde's field bark ("They have raised a hand to a Cantor...") is spoken here, just before the
// fight, until a battle-bark system exists (as Ch4 did; M3-C06-05).
title: ch06_raid
location: ch06/brine_shoals
---
@letterbox on
@camera W05
@music raid fade=1.0
@sfx stillguard_hum
@anim stillguard_a walk_torch
@anim stillguard_b walk_torch
@wait 2.5
@camera W06
@anim clerk heat_iron brazier
@anim stillguard_c hold_arm brand_girl
@wait 2.0
@camera W07
@face toma afraid 0.6
@wait 1.0
Asha [worried]: Toma. #line:ch06_raid_001
@wait 1.2
Asha [tender]: Toma. #line:ch06_raid_002
@wait 2.0
@camera W05
@sfx hatch_burst
@mark liss ridge_run run via=way_hull_sw
@sfx raid_hound_bay
@mark inquisitor inq_halt walk via=way_pile_e
@mark hound hound_halt walk via=way_pile_e
@anim liss collide rhen
Liss [determined]: Move or hide me, pick one. #line:ch06_raid_003
Asha [determined]: Here. #line:ch06_raid_004
@mark asha hold_asha walk via=way_hull_ne
@mark liss hold_liss walk via=way_hull_ne
@anim rhen throw_sail hatch
@mark rhen hold_rhen walk
@camera W08
@wait 1.0
@anim liss look_at rhen
Liss [neutral]: That's wright work. #line:ch06_raid_005 #whisper
Rhen [worried]: Not now. #line:ch06_raid_006 #whisper
<<set $ch06_sheltered_liss = true>>
@wait 1.0
@sfx sail_pulled
@camera W08_hatch
Inquisitor [neutral]: Lady Cantor. Step away from the hold. #line:ch06_raid_007
Asha [determined]: No. #line:ch06_raid_008
Inquisitor [neutral]: The Edict— #line:ch06_raid_009
Ysolde [cold]: —does not give you a Cantor's party, Inquisitor. #line:ch06_raid_010
@wait 1.0
@anim inquisitor look_at hound
Inquisitor [exhausted]: Loose. #line:ch06_raid_011
@sfx raid_hound_bay
@mark hound hold_mouth run
@mark toma shield_line run via=way_tents_e
@anim toma shield_up
Toma [determined]: On my shield. #line:ch06_raid_012
Ysolde [cold]: They have raised a hand to a Cantor. The Edict does not cover that. #line:ch06_raid_013
@letterbox off
===
